Object.assign(CASES,{tailwind:{title:"Tailwind Toys",text:"Tailwind Toys runs an online store in Central India.\n\n• The storefront is a .NET web app. New releases must be tested with 10% of real users before going live, with no downtime.\n• The storefront needs a custom domain shop.tailwindtoys.com with HTTPS, and must read from an Azure SQL database that's reachable only from vnet-data.\n• Order processing runs on VMs that must survive the loss of an entire datacenter.\n• Nightly image-resizing jobs run in containers for about 20 minutes and must stop when finished.\n• Container images are stored in a registry that must be reachable from both Central India and West Europe with low latency.\n• All infrastructure is deployed from Bicep files; a recent deployment unexpectedly deleted a test VM."}});
SERIES.s3="Note: This question is part of a series that presents the same scenario. Each question has a different solution. Determine whether the solution meets the goal. After you answer a question in this series, you can't return to it.";

